From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:10:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2060/3799] soh: rename D_80AB860C -> sYawWobbleAmounts

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: per-mode amount alternately added to and subtracted from the target yaw in EnNiw_HopTowardTarget
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c
index 6161d87de..963d56ff2 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c
@@ -72,7 +72,8 @@ static f32 sSwayTargets[] = {  // was D_80AB8604 [LLM:GUESS]
     -5000.0f,
 };
 
-static f32 D_80AB860C[] = {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was D_80AB860C: per-mode amount alternately added to and subtracted from the target yaw in EnNiw_HopTowardTarget
+static f32 sYawWobbleAmounts[] = {  // was D_80AB860C [LLM:HIGH]
     5000.0f,
     3000.0f,
     4000.0f,
@@ -411,9 +412,9 @@ void EnNiw_HopTowardTarget(EnNiw* this, PlayState* play, s32 arg2) {
         this->timer3 = 5;
     }
     if (this->unk_2A0 == 0) {
-        factor = D_80AB860C[arg2];
+        factor = sYawWobbleAmounts[arg2];  // was D_80AB860C [LLM:HIGH]
     } else {
-        factor = -D_80AB860C[arg2];
+        factor = -sYawWobbleAmounts[arg2];  // was D_80AB860C [LLM:HIGH]
     }
     if (arg2 == 1) {
         if (this->timer6 == 0 || this->actor.bgCheckFlags & BGCHECKFLAG_WALL) {
